---
import DocLayout from "../../layouts/DocLayout.astro";
import LightManagerTabs from "../../components/LightManagerTabs.astro";
import Icon from "../../components/Icon.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const iesThumbnails = Array.from(
  { length: 30 },
  (_, i) => `${base}icons/addon/ies-preview/${i + 1}.webp`,
);

const shapes = [
  { name: "Square", file: "square.webp" },
  { name: "Sphere", file: "sphere.webp" },
  { name: "Ring", file: "ring.webp" },
  { name: "Strip", file: "strip.webp" },
  { name: "Strip V2", file: "stip_v2.webp" },
  { name: "Linear", file: "linear.webp" },
];

const textures = [
  { name: "HDR Texture 1", file: "texture (1).webp" },
  { name: "HDR Texture 2", file: "texture (2).webp" },
  { name: "HDR Texture 3", file: "texture (3).webp" },
  { name: "HDR Texture 4", file: "texture (4).webp" },
  { name: "HDR Texture 5", file: "texture (5).webp" },
];

const gobos = [
  { name: "Caustics", file: "gobos (1).png" },
  { name: "Foliage", file: "gobos (2).jpg" },
  { name: "Foliage", file: "gobos (3).jpg" },
  { name: "Blinds", file: "gobos (4).png" },
];
---

<DocLayout title="Light Properties">
  <h1>Light Manager — Light Properties</h1>
  <LightManagerTabs activeTab="light-manager/light-properties" />

  <p class="mb-6">
    The <strong>Light Properties</strong> tab within the Main Panel UI expands Blender's
    native light data blocks, providing a centralized control panel for adjustments,
    photometric IES files, geographic sun rigs, and custom studio Softbox node modifiers.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Selected Light Tabs</h2>
  <p class="mb-4">
    When you select a light in the SLM list, the properties editor displays
    three main context tabs at the top:
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mb-8 text-xs">
    <!-- Properties Tab -->
    <div
      class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 font-mono text-white">
          <Icon name="PROPERTIES" />
          <span>Properties</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Displays advanced settings, custom shader node groups, Cycles/EEVEE
          engines override settings, and object transformations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Light Linking Tab -->
    <div
      class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 font-mono text-white">
          <Icon name="LIGHT_LINKING" />
          <span>Light Linking</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Configure which objects or collections in the scene are affected by
          (receive light from) the selected emitter.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Shadow Linking Tab -->
    <div
      class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300"
    >
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 font-mono text-white">
          <Icon name="SHADOW_LINKING" />
          <span>Shadow Linking</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Configure which objects or collections block shadows cast by this
          light, bypassing standard viewport constraints.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>2. The Properties Tab Sub-Panels</h2>
  <p class="mb-6">
    The main <strong>Properties</strong> tab contains four collapsible sub-sections
    designed to group related operations logically:
  </p>

  <div class="space-y-6">
    <!-- Panel A: Light Settings -->
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <Icon name="LIGHT" /> A. Light Settings (Physical Parameters)
      </h3>
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light">
        Controls the physical attributes, coordinates, and shape profiles of the
        active emitter:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >Type & Kelvin Temperature</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Switch type between <strong>Point</strong>, <strong>Sun</strong>, <strong
              >Spot</strong
            >, and <strong>Area</strong>. Toggle <strong>Use Temp</strong> to adjust
            the output using photorealistic Kelvin scales (e.g., <code
              >3200K</code
            > to <code>5500K</code>).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >Energy & Exposure</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Adjust basic power in Watts and exposure in stops. Exposure values
            are disabled if locked under a collection override.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >IES Profiles & Spawning</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Spawn IES lights directly using the exclusive <strong
              >IES Light</strong
            > operator in the <strong>+ Add...</strong> menu, or assign photometrically
            calibrated IES profiles (.ies files) onto existing Point lights using
            the interactive profile selector.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >Ray Visibility (Cycles)</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Selectively filter which ray paths (Camera, Diffuse, Glossy,
            Transmission, Volume) this light responds to.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel B: Shader Nodes Settings -->
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <Icon name="SHADING_RENDERED" /> B. Shader Nodes Settings (Softbox Engine)
      </h3>
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light">
        Allows replacing default nodes with advanced, procedurally map-driven
        shader configurations:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >Softbox Node Group Integration</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Assign the custom <strong>SLM-Soft_Box</strong> shader to replace standard
            nodes, or update the group definitions from external libraries dynamically.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >Viewport Shader Preview</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Generate and cache real-time 2D thumbnails of active emission trees.
            Includes toggles for auto-refreshing viewport indicators.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >Gobo & Light Maps</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Map photographic textures to project structured studio reflections
            or shadow gobos (blinds, trees, windows) directly from the list
            interface.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >Clearing / Library Sync</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Instantly wipe map textures or synchronize the active node structure
            with the core global settings in a single click.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel C: Cycles / EEVEE Settings -->
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <Icon name="RENDER_STILL" /> C. Render Engine Optimizations
      </h3>
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light">
        Contains specific properties optimized based on which rendering engine
        is active:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >Cycles Specific Settings</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed mb-1">
            Fine-tune performance-heavy render branches:
          </p>
          <ul
            class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-0.5 text-[10px] text-zinc-500 font-light"
          >
            <li>
              <strong>Max Bounces:</strong> Restrict recursive light paths.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Cast Shadows / Multiple Importance:</strong> Balance noise ratios.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Shadow Caustics / Portals:</strong> Guidance optimizations.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1"
            >EEVEE Specific Settings</strong
          >
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed mb-1">
            Configure rasterized screen shadow offsets:
          </p>
          <ul
            class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-0.5 text-[10px] text-zinc-500 font-light"
          >
            <li>
              <strong>Jitter & Filter Radius:</strong> Smooth pixel shadows.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Resolution Limit:</strong> Caps memory usage on large scenes.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Custom Distance:</strong> Culls light calculations beyond a
              boundary.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel D: Object Transforms -->
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
        <Icon name="ORIENTATION_GIMBAL" /> D. Object Transforms & Hierarchy
      </h3>
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light">
        Provides convenient spatial controls without leaving the main manager
        list:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1">Transform Data</strong>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Translate location coordinates, orientation Euler rotations, and
            scales.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1">Parent Tracking</strong>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Displays what item this emitter is currently constrained to.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <strong class="text-white text-xs block mb-1">Hierarchy Setup</strong>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-light text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Link and parent standard objects, helper flags, or rigs to targeted
            bones/empties.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>3. Custom Softbox Node Group (SLM-Soft_Box)</h2>
  <p class="mb-6">
    The <strong>SLM-Soft_Box</strong> custom node group simulates physical modifiers
    (honeycomb grids, frames, diffusers) directly inside Cycles shading paths. Below
    is the structural layout of the group inputs:
  </p>

  <!-- Node Group Screenshot Diagram -->
  <div
    class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl mb-8 group hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
  >
    <div
      class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-3"
    >
      <img
        src={`${base}lights_node_group/node_group.png`}
        alt="SLM Softbox Node Group Diagram"
        class="w-full h-auto max-h-[450px] object-contain mx-auto transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.01] zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px] block font-mono text-center"
      >SLM-Soft_Box Shader Node Group Layout Diagram</span
    >
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs mb-8">
    <!-- Root Parameters -->
    <div
      class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
        <Icon name="LIGHT" />
        <strong class="text-white text-xs">Core Emission Parameters</strong>
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light">
        <li>
          <strong>Mode:</strong> Selects the softbox shape (<code>Square</code>, <code
            >Disk</code
          >, <code>Strip</code>, <code>Spheric</code>).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Falloff:</strong> Toggles decay math between physical <code
            >Quadratic</code
          > and custom curves.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Border:</strong> Adjusts edge interpolation hardness between <code
            >Soft</code
          > and <code>Sharp</code>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Spread Angle:</strong> Controls beam throw coordinates from 180°
          down to 2° (gridded honeycombs).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Power / Exposure / Smooth:</strong> Fine-tune core brightness, stops,
          and highlight noise specular.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Coloring Systems -->
    <div
      class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
        <Icon name="COLOR" />
        <strong class="text-white text-xs">Coloring & Gradient Systems</strong>
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light">
        <li>
          <strong>Coloring Modes:</strong> Toggle inputs between standard <code
            >RGB</code
          >, <code>Kelvin</code>, and <code>Near/Far</code> gradients.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Color Temperature:</strong> Driven using physics-based Blackbody
          temperature vectors.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Gradient Mapping:</strong> Configure primary <code>Near</code> and
          secondary <code>Far</code> coordinates.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Contrast & Transitions:</strong> Tweak <code>Hardness</code> and
          <code>Middle Point Distance</code> bias values.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3
    class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5"
  >
    <Icon name="FILTER" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Expandable Softbox Foldout Panels
  </h3>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs mb-8">
    <!-- Panel 1 -->
    <div
      class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
    >
      <strong class="text-white flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1"
        ><Icon name="CURVE_BEZCIRCLE" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Ring & Strip v2</strong
      >
      <p class="text-zinc-500 text-[10px] leading-relaxed mb-2 font-light">
        Controls ring-shaped reflectors and custom coordinate rotations:
      </p>
      <ul
        class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 space-y-0.5 list-disc pl-3 font-light"
      >
        <li><strong>Ring Scale & Thickness</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Strip Rotation Angle (0° to 90°)</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Slide & Black Value Cutoffs</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel 2 -->
    <div
      class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
    >
      <strong class="text-white flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1"
        ><Icon name="GRID" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Grids & Distortions</strong
      >
      <p class="text-zinc-500 text-[10px] leading-relaxed mb-2 font-light">
        Subdivides the emitter area into grids or bends spherical shapes:
      </p>
      <ul
        class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 space-y-0.5 list-disc pl-3 font-light"
      >
        <li><strong>Subdivisions & Subdiv Mixer</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Spheric Coordinates (X, Y Bias)</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Linear Smoothness Adjustments</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel 3 -->
    <div
      class="bg-zinc-900/30 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300"
    >
      <strong class="text-white flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1"
        ><Icon name="MOD_NOISE" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Noise & Transparency</strong
      >
      <p class="text-zinc-500 text-[10px] leading-relaxed mb-2 font-light">
        Adds organic textures and manages ray tracing visibility:
      </p>
      <ul
        class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 space-y-0.5 list-disc pl-3 font-light"
      >
        <li><strong>Noise Mask Offset & Detail Roughness</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Per-ray visibility factors (Camera, Diffuse)</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Backfacing Cull & Transmission Depth limits</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Node Group Visual Showcase -->
  <h3
    class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 mb-4 mt-8 flex items-center gap-1.5"
  >
    <Icon name="LIGHT" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Softbox Shape Profiles
  </h3>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-6 gap-4 mb-8">
    {
      shapes.map((shape) => (
        <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2">
            <img
              src={`${base}lights_node_group/${shape.file}`}
              alt={`Shape Profile: ${shape.name}`}
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <span class="text-white text-xs font-mono block text-center mt-1">
            {shape.name}
          </span>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <h3
    class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5"
  >
    <Icon name="GRID" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> HDR Light Textures
  </h3>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 mb-8">
    {
      textures.map((tex) => (
        <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2">
            <img
              src={`${base}lights_node_group/${tex.file}`}
              alt={tex.name}
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <span class="text-white text-xs font-mono block text-center mt-1">
            {tex.name}
          </span>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <h3
    class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5"
  >
    <Icon name="SHADING_RENDERED" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Photographic Gobo Projections
  </h3>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-8">
    {
      gobos.map((gobo) => (
        <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-3 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
          <div class="aspect-square w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-2">
            <img
              src={`${base}lights_node_group/${gobo.file}`}
              alt={`Gobo: ${gobo.name}`}
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <span class="text-white text-xs font-mono block text-center mt-1">
            {gobo.name}
          </span>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <p class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px] italic mb-8 font-light text-center">
    *Note: The images above show only a few examples of the wide range of HDR
    textures and Gobo projections included with the addon.*
  </p>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>4. Calibrated IES Light Profiles</h2>
  <p class="mb-6">
    When the active light is a Point Light (or when you spawn a new IES Light
    via the Add menu), the properties panel displays an interactive IES Profile
    library. This library provides photometrically calibrated light shapes to
    simulate realistic architectural illumination (downlights, spotlights,
    bollards, wall washes, etc.).
  </p>

  <h3
    class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 mb-4 flex items-center gap-1.5"
  >
    <Icon name="LIGHT_DATA" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Photometric Profile Library Preview
  </h3>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-5 sm:grid-cols-6 md:grid-cols-10 gap-2 mb-8">
    {
      iesThumbnails.map((src, index) => (
        <div class="bg-zinc-900 border border-white/5 p-1 rounded-lg hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
          <img
            src={src}
            alt={`IES Profile #${index + 1}`}
            class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity select-none zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</DocLayout>
